    "subject_definitions:\n<Subject 1> is the woman in <Picture 1>, <Picture 2>, <Picture 3>, <Picture 4> and <Picture 5>, a white woman in her mid-twenties with dark brown, wavy, shoulder-length hair.\n\nsummary:\n[reference generation] <Subject 1> sits at a sunlit cafe table, looks up from her coffee and smiles at the camera.\n\nretention_analysis:\n<Subject 1> (appears in [Shot 1]): fully_preserved - the woman's facial identity and hairstyle are retained.\n\ndetailed_description:\nThe target video is a realistic, full-color cinematic shot with warm natural daylight and a shallow depth of field.\n[Shot 1] A medium close-up shows <Subject 1>, the young woman with dark brown wavy hair, wearing a plain navy crew-neck t-shirt, seated at a wooden table outside a cafe on a sunny city street. She looks down at a cup of coffee, then lifts her head and turns toward the camera with a relaxed, warm smile. The camera holds steady at eye level with a slow, slight push-in. Pedestrians pass softly out of focus in the background.\n\noverall_soundscape:\nGentle street ambience with distant traffic and quiet cafe chatter.\n\nnon_diegetic_music:\nN/A",
