  {
   "id": 39,
   "type": "MarkdownNote",
   "pos": [
    0,
    1880
   ],
   "size": [
    900,
    900
   ],
   "flags": {},
   "order": 38,
   "mode": 0,
   "inputs": [],
   "outputs": [],
   "title": "Read me",
   "properties": {},
   "widgets_values": [
    "## 4. A/B: native references vs RefCap\nChecks a RefCap against the photos it was captured from, on **your** character. All three branches share the model, seed, schedule and the **prompt node** (edit the prompt there), so differences come from the reference path alone.\n\n- **A** feeds the original photos to *MiniMax H3 Reference to Video*.\n- **B** uses *H3 RefCap Replay*. It should match A exactly (same seed, same pixels) if the RefCap was captured from these photos at this width/height.\n- **C** uses *H3 RefCap Apply (cached)*. Expect small differences from A.\n\n**Before queuing**\n- Connect the same photos, in the same order, that the RefCap was captured from. Set `refcap` in B and C.\n- Keep width/height/length equal in the three branches.\n- Clips land in `ComfyUI/output/h3_refcap/ab/`.\n\n**For numbers instead of eyes:** score the clips' faces against the photos with ArcFace (insightface), as the table below was measured.\n\n**Measured** (ArcFace face similarity to the photos; 2 London Set subjects x 2 scenes x 3 seeds, 608x352, 56 frames, on a community H3 turbo finetune at 8 steps):\n\n| path | vs native references (`match`) | recognisable as the person |\n|---|---|---|\n| native reference node | baseline (0.62-0.71) | 12/12 |\n| **H3 RefCap Replay** | identical, pixel for pixel | 12/12 |\n| Replay, RefCap captured from 1024 px photos with `max` | **+0.06**, higher in 12/12; ~2.2x render time, 163 MB file | 12/12 |\n| H3 RefCap Apply (cached) | -0.01 | 12/12 |\n| Apply, latents only / rows only | -0.08 / -0.27 | 12/12 |\n| RefMod Full Reference (ComfyUI-MiniMaxH3Mod, 1024 px) | +0.03 Apply, +0.05 Text Encode; the 1024 px RefCap beat its best path in 11/12 | 12/12 |\n| RefMod Compressed Reference | -0.60 to -0.62 | 0/12 |\n| no references | -0.66 | 0/12 |\n\n**More identity:** capture from ~1024 px photos with `ref_image_size` = `max`, if you can afford the render time. Details: `REFCAP_README.md` in ComfyUI-RefCap.\n\n**Settings in these workflows** follow ComfyUI's MiniMax H3 reference-to-video template: the ref2va model with its 4-step Lightning LoRA, 4 steps, `res_multistep` + `simple`, 608x352. For the base model, bypass the *Lightning LoRA* node and use 20 steps. The measurements quoted here ran on a community H3 turbo finetune (shift 6/3, 8 steps) on a 12 GB GPU. Raise the size and length for final renders; the reference tokens ride through every step, so more photos and larger captures cost time."
   ],
   "color": "#432",
   "bgcolor": "#653"
  }
